{
  "$schema": "iswc-preview/v1",
  "tag": "iswc-check-icon-button",
  "category": "actions",
  "title": "&lt;iswc-check-icon-button&gt;",
  "titleHtml": false,
  "description": "Documentación y demos del componente iswc-check-icon-button de InSoft.",
  "styles": [
    ".cluster { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }",
    "    .stack { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1rem; }",
    "    /* Simula la chrome de un reproductor: es el contexto real de appearance=plain */",
    "    .player-bar {",
    "      display: inline-flex;",
    "      align-items: center;",
    "      gap: 0.6rem;",
    "      padding: 0.5rem 0.85rem;",
    "      border-radius: var(--iswc-radius-sm);",
    "      background: rgb(0 0 0 / 72%);",
    "      color: #fff;",
    "      font-size: 0.8125rem;",
    "      backdrop-filter: blur(6px);",
    "    }",
    "    .player-bar .track {",
    "      width: 8rem;",
    "      height: 3px;",
    "      border-radius: 999px;",
    "      background: rgb(255 255 255 / 25%);",
    "    }",
    "    .player-bar .track > i {",
    "      display: block;",
    "      width: 40%;",
    "      height: 100%;",
    "      border-radius: inherit;",
    "      background: #fff;",
    "    }",
    "    .state-grid {",
    "      display: grid;",
    "      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(9rem, 1fr));",
    "      gap: 0.75rem;",
    "    }",
    "    .state-grid > div {",
    "      display: grid;",
    "      justify-items: center;",
    "      gap: 0.5rem;",
    "      padding: 0.75rem 0.5rem;",
    "      border: 1px solid var(--iswc-border-soft);",
    "      border-radius: var(--iswc-radius-sm);",
    "      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--iswc-bg) 55%, transparent);",
    "    }"
  ],
  "storageKey": "docs-iswc-check-icon-button",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "Uso",
      "lede": [
        "Botón icon-only con dos estados mutuamente excluyentes: muestra un solo icono",
        "          según <code class=\"code\">checked</code>. Lo usan <code class=\"code\">iswc-video</code>",
        "          (play/pausa, mute) e <code class=\"code\">iswc-theme-toggle</code>."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<div class=\"stack\">",
            "            <span class=\"demo-label\">caso mínimo</span>",
            "            <div class=\"cluster\">",
            "              <iswc-check-icon-button",
            "                id=\"demoPlay\"",
            "                icon=\"mdi:play\"",
            "                checked-icon=\"mdi:pause\"",
            "                label=\"Reproducir\"",
            "                checked-label=\"Pausar\"",
            "              ></iswc-check-icon-button>",
            "              <span class=\"card-meta\" id=\"playState\">estado: paused</span>",
            "            </div>",
            "          </div>"
          ],
          "controls": [
            {
              "control": "select",
              "prop": "attr:checked-icon",
              "label": "checked-icon",
              "options": [
                "mdi:pause",
                "mdi:volume-off",
                "mdi:weather-sunny",
                "mdi:heart",
                "mdi:bookmark",
                "mdi:eye",
                "mdi:fullscreen-exit",
                "mdi:microphone-off"
              ]
            },
            {
              "control": "select",
              "prop": "attr:label",
              "label": "label",
              "options": [
                "Reproducir",
                "Silenciar",
                "Cambiar a tema oscuro",
                "Añadir a favoritos",
                "Guardar",
                "Mostrar contraseña",
                "Pantalla completa",
                "Silenciar micrófono"
              ]
            },
            {
              "control": "boolean",
              "prop": "attr:checked",
              "label": "checked"
            },
            {
              "control": "text",
              "prop": "attr:variant",
              "label": "variant"
            },
            {
              "control": "boolean",
              "prop": "attr:disabled",
              "label": "disabled"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "callout",
          "html": [
            "<strong>Los dos labels son obligatorios.</strong>",
            "          El icono cambia pero el botón es el mismo nodo: sin",
            "          <code class=\"code\">label</code> y <code class=\"code\">checked-label</code>",
            "          un lector de pantalla anuncia lo mismo en ambos estados."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pairs",
      "title": "Pares de iconos",
      "lede": [
        "Cualquier par que represente dos estados opuestos. El componente no asume",
        "          semántica: tú eliges los iconos y los labels."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<div class=\"cluster\" style=\"gap: 1.25rem;\">",
            "            <iswc-check-icon-button icon=\"mdi:play\" checked-icon=\"mdi:pause\"",
            "              label=\"Reproducir\" checked-label=\"Pausar\"></iswc-check-icon-button>",
            "            <iswc-check-icon-button icon=\"mdi:volume-high\" checked-icon=\"mdi:volume-off\"",
            "              label=\"Silenciar\" checked-label=\"Activar sonido\"></iswc-check-icon-button>",
            "            <iswc-check-icon-button icon=\"mdi:weather-night\" checked-icon=\"mdi:weather-sunny\"",
            "              label=\"Cambiar a tema oscuro\" checked-label=\"Cambiar a tema claro\" checked></iswc-check-icon-button>",
            "            <iswc-check-icon-button icon=\"mdi:heart-outline\" checked-icon=\"mdi:heart\"",
            "              label=\"Añadir a favoritos\" checked-label=\"Quitar de favoritos\"></iswc-check-icon-button>",
            "            <iswc-check-icon-button icon=\"mdi:bookmark-outline\" checked-icon=\"mdi:bookmark\"",
            "              label=\"Guardar\" checked-label=\"Quitar de guardados\"></iswc-check-icon-button>",
            "            <iswc-check-icon-button icon=\"mdi:eye-off-outline\" checked-icon=\"mdi:eye\"",
            "              label=\"Mostrar contraseña\" checked-label=\"Ocultar contraseña\"></iswc-check-icon-button>",
            "          </div>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "appearance",
      "title": "Appearance",
      "lede": [
        "<code class=\"code\">appearance=\"plain\"</code> lo compacta y hereda el color del",
        "          contenedor: es la variante para chrome oscura sobre vídeo o imágenes."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<div class=\"stack\">",
            "            <span class=\"demo-label\">default · sobre superficie normal</span>",
            "            <div class=\"cluster\">",
            "              <iswc-check-icon-button icon=\"mdi:play\" checked-icon=\"mdi:pause\"",
            "                label=\"Reproducir\" checked-label=\"Pausar\"></iswc-check-icon-button>",
            "              <iswc-check-icon-button icon=\"mdi:volume-high\" checked-icon=\"mdi:volume-off\"",
            "                label=\"Silenciar\" checked-label=\"Activar sonido\"></iswc-check-icon-button>",
            "            </div>",
            "",
            "            <span class=\"demo-label\">appearance=\"plain\" · sobre chrome de vídeo</span>",
            "            <div class=\"player-bar\">",
            "              <iswc-check-icon-button variant=\"plain\" icon=\"mdi:play\" checked-icon=\"mdi:pause\"",
            "                label=\"Reproducir\" checked-label=\"Pausar\"></iswc-check-icon-button>",
            "              <span>0:42</span>",
            "              <span class=\"track\"><i></i></span>",
            "              <span>3:15</span>",
            "              <iswc-check-icon-button variant=\"plain\" icon=\"mdi:volume-high\" checked-icon=\"mdi:volume-off\"",
            "                label=\"Silenciar\" checked-label=\"Activar sonido\"></iswc-check-icon-button>",
            "              <iswc-check-icon-button variant=\"plain\" icon=\"mdi:fullscreen\" checked-icon=\"mdi:fullscreen-exit\"",
            "                label=\"Pantalla completa\" checked-label=\"Salir de pantalla completa\"></iswc-check-icon-button>",
            "            </div>",
            "          </div>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "states",
      "title": "Estados",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<div class=\"state-grid\">",
            "            <div>",
            "              <span class=\"demo-label\">unchecked</span>",
            "              <iswc-check-icon-button icon=\"mdi:heart-outline\" checked-icon=\"mdi:heart\"",
            "                label=\"Añadir a favoritos\" checked-label=\"Quitar de favoritos\"></iswc-check-icon-button>",
            "            </div>",
            "            <div>",
            "              <span class=\"demo-label\">checked</span>",
            "              <iswc-check-icon-button icon=\"mdi:heart-outline\" checked-icon=\"mdi:heart\"",
            "                label=\"Añadir a favoritos\" checked-label=\"Quitar de favoritos\" checked></iswc-check-icon-button>",
            "            </div>",
            "            <div>",
            "              <span class=\"demo-label\">disabled</span>",
            "              <iswc-check-icon-button icon=\"mdi:heart-outline\" checked-icon=\"mdi:heart\"",
            "                label=\"Añadir a favoritos\" checked-label=\"Quitar de favoritos\" disabled></iswc-check-icon-button>",
            "            </div>",
            "            <div>",
            "              <span class=\"demo-label\">disabled + checked</span>",
            "              <iswc-check-icon-button icon=\"mdi:heart-outline\" checked-icon=\"mdi:heart\"",
            "                label=\"Añadir a favoritos\" checked-label=\"Quitar de favoritos\" disabled checked></iswc-check-icon-button>",
            "            </div>",
            "          </div>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "keyboard",
      "title": "Teclado",
      "lede": "Deshabilitado pasa a <code class=\"code\">tabindex=\"-1\"</code> y no responde a teclado ni a puntero.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "columns": [
            "Tecla",
            "Acción"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "<code>Tab</code>",
              "Enfoca el botón (el host lleva <code>tabindex=\"0\"</code>)"
            ],
            [
              "<code>Enter</code> <code>Space</code>",
              "Alterna <code>checked</code> y emite <code>iswc-change</code>"
            ]
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "api",
      "title": "API live",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<div class=\"stack\">",
            "            <div class=\"cluster\">",
            "              <iswc-check-icon-button id=\"apiBtn\" icon=\"mdi:microphone\" checked-icon=\"mdi:microphone-off\"",
            "                label=\"Silenciar micrófono\" checked-label=\"Activar micrófono\"></iswc-check-icon-button>",
            "              <iswc-button id=\"apiToggle\" variant=\"outlined\">toggle()</iswc-button>",
            "              <iswc-button id=\"apiForce\" variant=\"outlined\">toggle(true)</iswc-button>",
            "              <iswc-button id=\"apiDisable\" variant=\"outlined\">Toggle disabled</iswc-button>",
            "            </div>",
            "          </div>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<div class=\"log\" id=\"apiLog\"><div class=\"row\"><span class=\"hint\">Eventos iswc-change aparecerán aquí.</span></div></div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "reference",
      "title": "Referencia",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "columns": [
            "Attr",
            "Notas"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "<code>checked</code> <span class=\"iswc-default-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>",
              "Reflejado (valor por defecto)"
            ],
            [
              "<code>icon</code> <span class=\"iswc-default-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>",
              "Iconify id cuando unchecked (valor por defecto)"
            ],
            [
              "<code>checked-icon</code> <span class=\"iswc-default-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>",
              "Iconify id cuando checked (valor por defecto)"
            ],
            [
              "<code>label</code> <span class=\"iswc-default-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>",
              "<code>aria-label</code> cuando unchecked (valor por defecto)"
            ],
            [
              "<code>checked-label</code> <span class=\"iswc-default-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>",
              "<code>aria-label</code> cuando checked (fallback: <code>label</code>) (valor por defecto)"
            ],
            [
              "<code>appearance</code>",
              "Compacto y hereda color, para chrome oscura"
            ],
            [
              "<code>disabled</code> <span class=\"iswc-default-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">★</span>",
              "Bloquea puntero y teclado (valor por defecto)"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "columns": [
            "API",
            "Detalle"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "propiedades",
              "<code>checked</code> · <code>disabled</code> · <code>icon</code> · <code>checkedIcon</code> · <code>label</code> · <code>checkedLabel</code>"
            ],
            [
              "métodos",
              "<code>toggle(force?)</code> — sin argumento invierte; con booleano fija el estado"
            ],
            [
              "eventos",
              "<code>iswc-change</code> con <code>{ checked }</code> (bubbles, composed)"
            ],
            [
              "parts",
              "<code>button</code> · <code>icon</code>"
            ],
            [
              "a11y",
              "El host es el control: <code>role=\"button\"</code>, <code>aria-pressed</code> y <code>aria-label</code> por estado"
            ]
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
